WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,720
I'm just crazy about action

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:10,580
It's not that the cripple is crazy, right? Hurry up and get it. What kind of money do you want?

3
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:15,080
My car has been done by you and needs to be cleaned.

4
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:16,920
Wash your car for free, 100 yuan

5
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:19,040
But me

6
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:20,240
Me, Mao and I

7
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:21,480
One hundred dollars, bring it

8
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:33,260
What are you doing?

9
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:34,620
Hurry up, I'll hurry up

10
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:40,430
Save you

11
00:00:40,430 --> 00:00:47,480
Damn it

12
00:00:47,680 --> 00:00:50,020
Nothing goes smoothly today

13
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:53,020
These people are here to find you, right? You stole it.

14
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:54,420
